# Code owners for Mallow. See GOVERNANCE.md for who the maintainers are.
#
# GitHub uses the LAST matching pattern for each file, so the specific rules come after
# the default. Today one maintainer owns everything. When new maintainers join, add
# them here, and give every security-sensitive path below at least two owners.
#
# Security-sensitive paths need two approving reviews (CONTRIBUTING.md, "Security-sensitive
# changes"). CODEOWNERS only requests reviews; it cannot require two of them. Maintainers
# enforce the two-review rule, and the branch ruleset for `main` should require code owner
# review.

# Default owner for everything
*                                                   @mixutin

